        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are a concise market analyst. Below are REAL news headlines from today. Read them carefully and identify genuine opportunities based ONLY on what is in the headlines.\n\nUS STOCKS: {{ $json.usData }}\n\nUK STOCKS: {{ $json.ukData }}\n\nEUROPE & ASIA: {{ $json.globalData }}\n\nCATALYSTS: {{ $json.catalystData }}\n\nCRYPTO: {{ $json.cryptoData }}\n\nBased ONLY on the real headlines above, give me the top 10 opportunities. Use only tickers mentioned in the headlines.\n\nFor each write exactly:\n[number]. TICKER \u2014 Company \u2014 what they do\nWhy: one line from the headlines\nRisk: Low/Medium/High | Action: Buy/Watch/Avoid\n\nThen write:\nAVOID: any tickers mentioned negatively\nMOOD: one sentence summary\n\nRULES:\n- Only use tickers from the headlines above\n- Never write [Ticker] or [Price] placeholders\n- If fewer than 10 real opportunities exist write fewer \u2014 do not invent\n- Plain text only, no markdown, no bold, no code, no headers\n- Max 1500 characters total"
            }
          ]
        },
